# Lobium patch apply order (quilt). One patch path per line; grouped by domain.
#
# STRATEGY: nearly all Lobium logic lives in ADDED files under //components/lobium_fp/ (staged by
# build.sh, see ../src/) which never conflict on rebase. The patches below are the MINIMAL hook points
# into existing Chromium files — each just routes a surface through lobium::LobiumFpConfig::Current().
# Keeping them tiny is what makes tracking Chrome stable within days feasible (see rebase.sh).
#
# Status: authored against the pinned ref (build.sh CHROMIUM_REF); each is refreshed + compiled on the
# build machine (T-010/T-011). See hooks.md for the hook point + code of each.
#
# --- Core: config channel + navigator/UA-CH (T-011 — first native surfaces) ---
# core/build-gn.patch — ✅ registers the added //components/lobium_fp module in the build graph
#   (blink core dep + core/DEPS include-rule).
core/build-gn.patch
# core/config-channel.patch — ✅ BUILT + PROVEN on Chromium 152. Browser reads --lobium-fp-config and
#   forwards base64 --lobium-fp-data to the renderer (cached, size-guarded, logged); the renderer's
#   LobiumFpConfig::Current() serves it. Surfaces hooked here (all proven): hardwareConcurrency,
#   deviceMemory (+ client-hint header), maxTouchPoints, WebGL unmasked vendor/renderer, and canvas 2D
#   farbling (getImageData/toDataURL/toBlob/OffscreenCanvas.convertToBlob). The single-value --lobium-hwc
#   POC switch is retained as a fallback. See hooks.md for the per-surface hook points + code.
core/config-channel.patch
# core/navigator-ua-ch.patch          # NOT YET AUTHORED — navigator.* + Sec-CH-UA from config (userAgent/platform/langs/hw)
#
# --- Fingerprint deep surfaces (the native moat) ---
# WebGL vendor/renderer + canvas 2D farbling are BUILT + PROVEN — they live in config-channel.patch
# above (folded in during their commits). Audio farbling is BUILT + PROVEN as its own patch below
# (deep surfaces get an independent patch from here on so one can rebase without disturbing the others).
# fingerprint/audio-context.patch — ✅ BUILT + PROVEN on Chromium 152. Seeded Web Audio farbling
#   (seeds.audio): OfflineAudioContext result (getChannelData/copyFromChannel — the dominant vector) +
#   AnalyserNode float freq/time paths, via the added kernel //components/lobium_fp/lobium_audio_farble.cc.
#   Playback-safe (audio_buffer.cc untouched), stereo-coherent. See hooks.md for hook points + limitations.
fingerprint/audio-context.patch
# fingerprint/screen-dpr.patch — ✅ BUILT + PROVEN on Chromium 152. Persona screen geometry + colour
#   depth + DPR from config: Screen::GetRect (width/height/avail*), Screen::colorDepth, and the DPR
#   through BOTH window.devicePixelRatio and the CSS media-query path (MediaValues) so matchMedia agrees.
#   Removes the headless 800x600 tell. See hooks.md for hook points + deferred limitations.
fingerprint/screen-dpr.patch
